{
  "name": "_shootoutStartMenu",
  "comment": "OpenSWOS's PENALTY SHOOTOUT start screen, SWOS 2020's layout (src/penalty_shootout_menu.c). Shown by ShowFriendlyMenu in place of the friendly's own screen while g_penaltyShootoutMode is on. CHOOSE TEAMS is the friendly's ChooseTeamsMenu; ALL RANDOM and the nine group buttons (ordinals 4..13, read by ShootoutRandomTeams) draw two teams of the group, the player's side first and the computer's second, then play them as CHOOSE TEAMS would (the PLAY MATCH screen comes next). GOALKEEPER CONTROL PLAYER/COMPUTER draws through _shootoutKeeperStrTable (g_shootoutKeeperComputer). No handler may call CommonMenuExit (docs/MENUS.md section 12). Both targets: a classic packed menu, so the m68k build gets it from the baked src/menu_data.c.",
